cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MIZAN, please cite it as below."
title: "MIZAN: a trust layer for decisions in the age of AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Three local decision systems for bilingual procurement evidence review (SANAD),
  calibrated visual inspection (BASIRA) and risk-aware energy planning (RASID).
  Every answer is signed, explained only from its own proof, accompanied by
  executed counterfactuals and verifiable offline or in a browser. AI agents can
  use it through the Model Context Protocol without gaining authority.
  All bundled datasets are generated fixtures.
type: software
